# Astro also emits a meta-refresh page for this route (see `redirects` in
# astro.config.mjs), which is what a plain static host can do. Cloudflare can
# do better, so it answers with a real 301 before that page is ever served.
# Both are kept: the HTML is the fallback if this file is ever dropped.

